<!--
    comp_light.rou.xml
    ==================
    COMPOSITION: Light Fleet (low-CO2, car-dominant)
      car_standard:    80%  (up from 40%) — HBEFA3/PC_G_EU4
      vehicle_general: 10%  (same)        — HBEFA3/PC_G_EU4
      delivery_van:     5%  (down from 10%)
      bus_city:         2%  (down from 15%)
      truck_light:      2%  (down from 15%)
      coach_long:       1%  (down from 10%)

    Same total demand structure as baseline (568 veh/hr, 142/approach).
    run_composition_experiment.py scales vehsPerHour by (target_vol / 568).

    Per approach turn split: S=37%, L=32%, R=31%.
    Per approach straight (52.5 veh/hr): car=42.0, gen=5.3, van=2.6, bus=1.1, trk=1.1, coa=0.5
    Per approach left (45.4 veh/hr): car=36.3, gen=4.5, van=2.3, bus=0.9, trk=0.9, coa=0.5
    Per approach right (44.0 veh/hr): car=35.2, gen=4.4, van=2.2, bus=0.9, trk=0.9, coa=0.4
-->
